# Flutter app leftovers. The mobile_app branch shares this working tree, so its
# files stay on disk after switching back here. android/ and ios/ are tracked
# *on that branch* — ignoring them here only stops them being committed to the
# web branches by accident, it does not untrack them there.
/.dart_tool/
/.flutter-plugins
/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
/android/
/ios/
/build/
/web/
*.iml
